The terms of reference of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee inter-alia include the following:
The Nomination and Remuneration Committee (“NRC”) identifies, evaluates and recommends to the Board the appropriate mix of qualifications, competencies, skills, experience, integrity and other positive attributes required for the Board and its individual members. This process is undertaken with the objective of ensuring an effective, well-balanced and diverse Board that supports sound governance and the long-term strategic objectives of the Company.
i. To identify persons who are qualified to become directors and who may be appointed in the senior management and to lay down the criteria thereof;
