iii. To evaluate the individual director’s performance;
The Committee is responsible for formulating evaluation policies and reviewing all major aspects of Company’s HR processes relating to hiring, training, talent management, succession planning and compensation structure of the Directors, KMPs and Senior Management Personnel.
